    <mj-section padding-top="12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hello,&nbsp;*|FNAME|*</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          You canceled your II&nbsp;pillar application for making contributions. Contributions to
          your II&nbsp;pillar will not start.
        </mj-text>
